Name: go-github
Short Name: go-github
URL: https://github.com/google/go-github
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: LICENSE
Version: v69.2.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/go-github
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/go-github

Description:
Go library for accessing the GitHub API v3. Used across Aphrody GCP, Google Cloud Workflows,
and the automated 24/7 indexing and repository watcher pipeline.

Local Modifications:
- Forked to aphrody-labs/go-github and yolo-rs/go-github.
- Native integration with Aphrody GitHub PAT and fine-grained org administration tokens.
- Wrapped by packages/github-client for seamless consumption from Bun via bun:ffi or child subprocess.
